ership index\"],\"api\":[\"documented handoff\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"UI implementation\",\"PWA delivery\",\"release claims\"],\"verification\":\"Review cross-checks all SHARD-02 contracts and retained gates.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"None; documents GATE-0004 and provenance review without resolving either.\",\"complexity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0021\",\"title\":\"Define shared session and safe checkpoint presentation model\",\"domain\":\"session\",\"targets\":[\"shared\",\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0005\",\"REQ-0006\",\"NFR-0002\",\"NFR-0003\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A framework-neutral session model covers launch, title, new-or-resume, play, pause, ending, focus loss, and confirmed checkpoint state without owning persistence drivers or platform layout.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0004\",\"IMP-0006\",\"IMP-0017\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/app/session/\",\"tests/app/session/\"],\"data\":[\"session and checkpoint view state\"],\"api\":[\"session intent and safe-boundary API\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"browser lifecycle implementation\",\"cache refresh\",\"new save schema\",\"network services\"],\"verification\":\"Deterministic tests prove focus loss pauses safely and unconfirmed saves never present as confirmed.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0003 and GATE-0004 remain implementation gates for storage and concrete campaign assumptions.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0022\",\"title\":\"Define semantic responsive game-shell and navigation contract\",\"domain\":\"ui\",\"targets\":[\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0007\",\"REQ-0009\",\"REQ-0010\",\"NFR-0004\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A semantic shell specifies title, main controls, status, panels, dialogs, visible focus, reflow, and non-colour cues around the shared game state without a PWA-specific UI fork.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0010\",\"IMP-0021\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/app/shell/\",\"src/platform/web/layout/\",\"tests/app/shell/\"],\"data\":[\"semantic navigation and viewport profiles\"],\"api\":[\"panel and focus routing API\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"final art/fonts\",\"fixed supported-device claims\",\"service worker\",\"duplicated PWA UI\"],\"verification\":\"Representative fixtures retain labelled controls and legal focus order through resize and panel changes.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0002 and GATE-0004 remain explicit for numeric thresholds and final content/layout choices.\",\"complexity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0023\",\"title\":\"Map semantic actions across keyboard, pointer, touch, and gamepad\",\"domain\":\"input\",\"targets\":[\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0005\",\"REQ-0009\",\"NFR-0004\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"One action vocabulary maps movement, inspect, confirm, cancel, pause, panels, and legal combat choices across supported inputs with safe repeat and disconnect handling.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0002\",\"IMP-0021\",\"IMP-0022\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/platform/web/input/\",\"src/app/input/\",\"tests/platform/input/\"],\"data\":[\"input binding and availability state\"],\"api\":[\"semantic input action API\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"native clients\",\"voice recognition\",\"arbitrary remapping guarantee\",\"input-specific rules\"],\"verification\":\"Fixtures prove equivalent semantic actions, no duplicate destructive confirmation, and usable fallback after gamepad disconnect.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0002 remains for approved browser/device compatibility claims.\",\"complexity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"IMP-0024\",\"title\":\"Specify accessible settings, captions, and feedback preferences\",\"domain\":\"accessibility\",\"targets\":[\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0007\",\"REQ-0010\",\"NFR-0004\",\"NFR-0005\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"Settings and feedback contracts cover text, contrast, moti